f-dvd-storage (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * DVD-ROM SCSI commands: GET CONFIGURATION (0x46),
    READ DVD STRUCTURE (0xAD), READ DISC INFORMATION (0x51).
  * READ TOC: multi-session support + Mac OS X SFF8020i raw format.
  * Raises optical image size limit from ~1.1 GB (CD) to ~8.5 GB (DVD-9 DL).
  * INQUIRY reports "File-DVD Gadget" for images > 900 MB.
  * symbol_rename.h: coexists with stock f_mass_storage.ko.
  * udev rules for automatic gadget setup on UDC hotplug.

 -- Sergey <sergey004@github>  Mon, 19 May 2025 00:00:00 +0200
